# Russian translation for TinePlayer.
#
# Reviewed by a native speaker on 2026-08-17, in Poedit, against the whole
# catalog. It was drafted here first and is no longer a draft.
#
# Still worth a second look, none of it blocking:
#
#   - Kodi's own vocabulary - "Player Type", "user data folder", "Additional
#     Player". These were translated from the English rather than taken from
#     Kodi's own Russian, so somebody who has set Kodi up in Russian may find
#     they read as a second vocabulary for the same things.
#
#   - The keyboard and gamepad columns on the shortcut page, several of which
#     are key caps rather than words and are meant to pass through unchanged.
#
# Jellyfin's terms are settled: "Quick Connect" as "Быстрое подключение" is
# what Jellyfin's own Russian uses, confirmed 2026-08-17.
#
# Plural-Forms is the standard Russian rule: three forms, and the one for 2-4
# is not the one for 5+.
#
